Subject: [PATCH] test(claude-eval): G204 counter-review probes of the change
 journal

Pinned: four concurrent processes lose no intent, symlinked path followed
(J3), abandoned intent has no terminal state (J4), revisions not checked
for monotony (J5). Strict xfail: J1 a late _advance can move an INDEXED
intent back to PUBLISHED; J2 the journal file follows the process umask
(0644) although it lists private ids.

